{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong>\u00a0:<br>Inferis: Dead Below is a first-person psychological horror and walking simulator experience, offering approximately 45 to 50 minutes of intense gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.poster.avif?t=1761312981\" width=1600 height=866 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.webm?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.mp4?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Overview:</strong><br> Journalist Larry descends into the underground tunnels, following the pleas of families who haven\u2019t heard from their missing loved ones for a long time. Initially setting out to fulfill his duty as a reporter, Larry is soon pulled into a nightmare that tests both his mental and physical limits. As the line between reality and hallucination blurs, he finds himself edging closer to a dark secret that no human mind should ever uncover. The journey becomes not only a mission to uncover the truth\u2014but a fight to save his own soul.<br><br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immersive First-Person Experience:</i> Step into the darkness through Larry\u2019s eyes and explore a terrifying underground world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Psychological Horror:</i> A unique narrative where the boundaries of reality blur and mental collapse feels imminent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Atmospheric Sound Design:</i> High-quality audio and ambient effects that keep players on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Heavy and Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</i> A tension-filled world shaped by fear of tight spaces and the unknown.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Turn Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919230/d81c6c3441cc6ffe16abc3c3e64f299b51da681d.jpg"},{"name":"still wait","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919230/f906d8deb9080b08ba2779fc9e085b5dbc490558.jpg"},{"name":"destroy the wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919230/b3bcb3a8e458bc63dda42d4ccb174aada74db9ee.jpg"},{"name":"Cut and Smash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919230/441842a1507d7c4d84206f796417132ca8250a42.jpg"},{"name":"Be Careful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919230/00e48b2f2e0d50ae71a9cf415b6f3f30f4081a41.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919230?t=1761312981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919230?t=1761312981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/8b4eb8a69655f65fd4cd3d30518623c3e44ca6c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761312981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/8b4eb8a69655f65fd4cd3d30518623c3e44ca6c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761312981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of blood, gore, and disturbing imagery that may not be suitable for all players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong>\u00a0:<br>Inferis: Dead Below is a first-person psychological horror and walking simulator experience, offering approximately 45 to 50 minutes of intense gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.poster.avif?t=1761312981\" width=1600 height=866 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.webm?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.mp4?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Overview:</strong><br> Journalist Larry descends into the underground tunnels, following the pleas of families who haven\u2019t heard from their missing loved ones for a long time. Initially setting out to fulfill his duty as a reporter, Larry is soon pulled into a nightmare that tests both his mental and physical limits. As the line between reality and hallucination blurs, he finds himself edging closer to a dark secret that no human mind should ever uncover. The journey becomes not only a mission to uncover the truth\u2014but a fight to save his own soul.<br><br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immersive First-Person Experience:</i> Step into the darkness through Larry\u2019s eyes and explore a terrifying underground world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Psychological Horror:</i> A unique narrative where the boundaries of reality blur and mental collapse feels imminent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Atmospheric Sound Design:</i> High-quality audio and ambient effects that keep players on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Heavy and Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</i> A tension-filled world shaped by fear of tight spaces and the unknown.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Hemoria Studio"],"genres"